WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.115
Open Checkpoints using the flag icon.

2
00:00:03.115 --> 00:00:06.714
Choose + Checkpoint and set the scope to Entire Book.

3
00:00:06.714 --> 00:00:11.846
Name the version, then choose Create checkpoint.

4
00:00:11.846 --> 00:00:16.405
The saved Checkpoint is ready to open or compare later.
